                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a296e600-53d1-4b43-a1c5-0a30980555b8",
                                                "sense_id": "d71f9392-955f-34f5-b99d-a4f4022bff69",
                                                "text": "Though Bane’s sing-song voice gives his pronouncements a funny lilt, he doesn’t have any of the Joker’s deranged wit, and Nolan isn’t interested in undercutting his seriousness for the sake of a breezier entertainment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42b31d47-07e0-4388-9d6f-5aff912adcc9",
                                                "sense_id": "d71f9392-955f-34f5-b99d-a4f4022bff69",
                                                "text": "His pronouncements carried great authority, but his physical difficulties often caused them to be enigmatic in their brevity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93221ce2-3b15-4e75-81e6-2610b27fda63",
                                                "sense_id": "d71f9392-955f-34f5-b99d-a4f4022bff69",
                                                "text": "This grinchy pronouncement by the president had the value of being truthful."
